+
+| Function | Total (50 runs) | Per call |
+|---|---|---|
+| slow_sum | 0.1166 s | 0.002332 s |
+| fast_sum | 0.02176 s | 0.000435 s |
+
+Ratio (slow / fast): ~5.36x.
+
+Answer: **Yes**, `fast_sum` is faster than `slow_sum` for a list of 100000 ints (~5.4x faster).
